I think the answer is there, courtesy of the comment by baptiste below the
accepted answer.

Instead of:
 gt <- gt[3,4]

try:
 library(gtable)
 gt <- gtable_filter(gt, "panel")

and then continue as in the reproducible example included in the accepted
answer on stackoverflow.

Ron.

