Hi all, say I construct a plot using the following:

library(ggplot2)

myData <- data.frame("xVar" = c(1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256),
                     "yVar" = 1:9)

ggplot(data = myData, aes(x = xVar, y = yVar)) +
  geom_line() +
  scale_x_continuous(trans = "log2")

