You can also add the background rectangles with  a single call to annotate by supplying vectors with the relevant coordinates and colors:

  annotate(geom="rect", xmin=c(0.85,0,0.85,0.85), xmax=c(1,0.85,1,0),
                 ymin=c(0,0.85,0.85,0), ymax=c(0.85,1,1,0.85),
                 fill=c("orange","orange","green","red"), alpha=0.2)

